This has reminded me of YANI for a non-aligned artefact: The Boots of 
Rincewind.

Readers of the Discworld series will know the Rincewind is a 
below-level-0 wizard who is a professional coward, and thus excels at 
running away.  His boots would give you extreme speed (faster than 
normal boots of speed), but only when you were running away from danger.

OST this is really YANSNI, as it would be a PITA to implement (unless 
you can nick the "fleeing" code) and they would not be too useful 
outside a small range of situations.  (Except for pacifists.)  And they 
might be good for weaponless monks who are sick of getting weapons from 
their gods.  We need more non-weapon artefacts!

